    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to permitting hunting with crossbows in certain circumstances; and to amend chapter 483 of the laws of 2010, amending the environmental conservation law relating to hunting by crossbow, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S6747",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6747-2011",
